Package: ld2450-radar
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-serial
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Cosmin B. Memetea <14771785+CosminBMemetea@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/CosminBMemetea/querra-fence
Description: Live web radar for the HiLink LD2450 24 GHz mmWave sensor
 Reads the LD2450 through a USB-serial adapter (CH340) and serves a live
 top-down radar view on port 8077: up to three targets with smooth motion,
 trails, a heatmap, a 60-second distance chart and an activity feed.
 Runs as a system service and reconnects when the adapter is replugged.
